oke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down transition-transform duration-200\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-3.5\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"font-body text-sm text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\">Sign in</a><a href=\"/pricing\" class=\"font-body text-sm font-semibold bg-brand-gold text-brand-black rounded-full px-[22px] py-[11px] shadow-[0_4px_18px_rgba(245,166,35,0.20)] hover:bg-brand-gold-dim transition-all\">Start free</a></div><div class=\"md:hidden flex items-center gap-2\"><button class=\"text-ink\" aria-label=\"Open menu\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 5h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 12h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 19h16\"></path></svg></button></div></div></nav><main><section class=\"relative bg-ground py-32 px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px] overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0\"><div class=\"overflow-hidden  absolute inset-0\"><div class=\"neb-field\"></div><div class=\"neb-field-hot\"></div><div class=\"neb-halo\"></div><div class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 rounded-full border border-brand-gold/[0.16]\" style=\"width:300px;height:300px\"></div><div class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 rounded-full border border-brand-gold/[0.08]\" style=\"width:440px;height:440px\"></div><div class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[54px] h-[54px] rounded-full\" style=\"background:radial-gradient(circle at 36% 32%, #FFE1AC 0%, #F5A623 52%, #8A5406 100%);box-shadow:0 0 60px 12px rgba(245,166,35,0.35)\"></div></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 neb-hero-fade-x\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 neb-hero-fade-y\"></div></div><div class=\"relative grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-[60px] items-center\"><div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)\"><span class=\"neb-label neb-label-gold mb-[26px] block\">AI marketing &amp; outreach agents</span></div><h1 class=\"font-heading text-[40px] md:text-[52px] lg:text-[68px] leading-[1.06] lg:leading-[1.04] tracking-[-0.02em] font-medium text-ink mb-[22px]\" style=\"text-wrap:pretty;opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)\">Give us a URL.<br/><span class=\"italic text-gold-display\">We&#x27;ll run your marketing.</span></h1><p class=\"text-lg leading-[1.65] text-ink-2 max-w-[520px] mb-8\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)\">Your competitor isn&#x27;t better — they&#x27;re just louder. Nebulaa reads your brand in about a minute, then writes your posts, publishes every morning, and answers enquiries on WhatsApp while they&#x27;re still warm.</p><form class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 max-w-[480px] mb-3\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)\"><input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"yourbrand.com\" class=\"flex-1 min-w-0 bg-surface border border-rule-2 rounded-full px-6 py-4 sm:py-[15px] text-[15px] text-ink placeholder:text-faint outline-none focus:border-gold transition\" value=\"\"/><button type=\"submit\" class=\"bg-gold text-[#1A1208] text-[15px] font-semibold px-[30px] py-4 sm:py-[15px] rounded-full shadow-[0_6px_26px_rgba(245,166,35,0.24)] hover:brightness-105 transition whitespace-nowrap\">Start free →</button></form><p class=\"text-[13px] text-muted mb-6\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)\">Free to start · No credit card required · <a href=\"/services\" class=\"text-ink-2 hover:text-gold-text transition underline underline-offset-2\">or have our team run it</a></p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2.5 gap-y-1.5 text-[13px] text-muted\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#4ADE80] inline-block\"></span><span>7-day trial</span><span>·</span><span>Set up with you in 24 hrs</span><span>·</span><span>Cancel anytime</span></div></div><div class=\"hidden lg:flex justify-end\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)\"><div class=\"w-full max-w-[380px] pt-8\"><div class=\"neb-label mb-4\">Reading nebulaa-client.com</div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2.5\"><div class=\"font-body text-[12.5px] text-ink-2 flex items-center gap-2.5\"><span class=\"text-[#4ADE80]\">✓</span>Brand voice — confident, warm, unhurried</div><div class=\"font-body text-[12.5px] text-ink-2 flex items-center gap-2.5\"><span class=\"text-[#4ADE80]\">✓</span>Customers — retail buyers, 25–45, Tamil Nadu</div><div class=\"font-body text-[12.5px] text-ink-2 flex items-center gap-2.5\"><span class=\"text-[#4ADE80]\">✓</span>3 competitors tracked</div></div></div></div></div></section><div class=\"border-y border-rule py-12 px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px] flex items-center gap-11 flex-wrap\"><span class=\"neb-label  flex-shrink-0\">Working with</span><div class=\"flex items-center gap-9 flex-wrap\"><span class=\"font-heading text-xl text-ink-2\">Gandhimathi Jewellers</span><span class=\"font-heading text-xl text-ink-2\">JKR Tex</span><span class=\"font-heading text-xl text-ink-2\">TNV Chits</span><span class=\"font-heading text-xl text-faint\">Rajaram&#x27;s<span class=\"font-body text-[11px] tracking-[0.08em] uppercase\"> · in progress</span></span><span class=\"font-heading text-xl text-faint\">Nellai Kuttam Snacks<span class=\"font-body text-[11px] tracking-[0.08em] uppercase\"> · in progress</span></span></div></div><section id=\"how-it-works\" class=\"py-[130px] px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px]\"><div class=\"max-w-[640px] mb-[78px]\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)\"><span class=\"neb-label neb-label-gold mb-[22px] block\">What actually happens</span></div><h2 class=\"font-heading text-[33px] md:text-[50px] leading-[1.14] md:leading-[1.12] tracking-[-0.02em] font-medium\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)\">It does the three things you <span class=\"italic text-gold-text\">keep meaning to do.</span></h2></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6\"><div class=\"bg-surface border border-rule rounded-[18px] p-9\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)\"><div class=\"font-heading text-[46px] text-gold-text/35 leading-none mb-7\">01</div><h3 class=\"font-heading text-[25px] font-medium mb-3.5\">It learns how you talk</h3><p class=\"font-body text-[15px] leading-[1.68] text-muted\">Paste your website. A minute later it knows your tone, who buys from you, and what your three closest rivals put out this week. No brief to write. No onboarding call to sit through.</p></div><div class=\"bg-surface border border-rule rounded-[18px] p-9\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)\"><div class=\"font-heading text-[46px] text-gold-text/35 leading-none mb-7\">02</div><h3 class=\"font-heading text-[25px] font-medium mb-3.5\">It plans the month, then runs it</h3><p class=\"font-body text-[15px] leading-[1.68] text-muted\">Not a post at a time — a month, mapped out and drafted in your voice: posts, carousels, the occasional reel. Diwali and Pongal are already in the plan, so you never wake up on the day with nothing ready.</p></div><div class=\"bg-surface border border-rule rounded-[18px] p-9\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)\"><div class=\"font-heading text-[46px] text-gold-text/35 leading-none mb-7\">03</div><h3 class=\"font-heading text-[25px] font-medium mb-3.5\">It answers before they cool</h3><p class=\"font-body text-[15px] leading-[1.68] text-muted\">An enquiry at nine on a Sunday night doesn’t wait for Monday. Pulsar replies in minutes, asks what you’d have asked, and brings you in once there’s a real buyer on the other end.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"py-[130px] px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px]\"><div class=\"max-w-[660px] mb-[62px]\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)\"><span class=\"neb-label neb-label-gold mb-[22px] block\">Two ways in</span></div><h2 class=\"font-heading text-[34px] md:text-[50px] leading-[1.14] md:leading-[1.12] tracking-[-0.02em] font-medium mb-5\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)\">Who should be running this — <span class=\"italic text-gold-text\">you, or us?</span></h2><p class=\"font-body text-[17px] leading-[1.68] text-muted\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)\">Same agents underneath. The only question is whose evening it takes.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\"><div class=\"bg-surface rounded-[20px] pt-[46px] px-6 md:px-[42px] pb-11 border border-rule\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)\"><span class=\"neb-label  mb-[26px] block\">The software</span><h3 class=\"font-heading text-[32px] font-medium tracking-[-0.015em] mb-4\">I&#x27;ll run it myself</h3><p class=\"font-body text-[15.5px] leading-[1.68] text-muted mb-[30px]\">You drive. Set up in an afternoon, approve the week&#x27;s posts from your phone in about nine minutes, cancel the month it stops earning its keep.</p><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 mb-[34px]\"><div class=\"text-[14.5px] text-ink-2\">From ₹10,000/month</div><div class=\"text-[14.5px] text-muted\">7-day trial, no card</div></div><a class=\"inline-block text-[14.5px] font-semibold px-[26px] py-[15px] rounded-full transition-colors bg-gold text-[#1A1208] hover:bg-gold-dim\" href=\"#pricing\">See pricing</a></div><div class=\"bg-surface rounded-[20px] pt-[46px] px-6 md:px-[42px] pb-11 border border-gold/[0.18] shadow-[inset_0_1px_0_0_rgba(255,214,150,0.07)]\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)\"><span class=\"neb-label neb-label-gold mb-[26px] block\">The team</span><h3 class=\"font-heading text-[32px] font-medium tracking-[-0.015em] mb-4\">Someone else runs it</h3><p class=\"font-body text-[15.5px] leading-[1.68] text-muted mb-[30px]\">We drive. Our team plans, writes, ships and chases — with the same agents carrying the volume, which is why we come in under the agency quoting you now. You approve. You never log in.</p><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 mb-[34px]\"><div class=\"text-[14.5px] text-ink-2\">Managed marketing engagements</div><div class=\"text-[14.5px] text-muted\">Scoped per business</div></div><a class=\"inline-block text-[14.5px] font-semibold px-[26px] py-[15px] rounded-full transition-colors border border-rule-2 text-ink-2 hover:border-gold hover:text-gold-text\" href=\"/services\">Talk to us</a></div></div></section><section class=\"py-[130px] px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px]\"><div class=\"max-w-[680px] mb-[46px]\"><span class=\"neb-label neb-label-gold mb-[22px] block\">One run, start to finish</span><h2 class=\"font-heading text-[34px] md:text-[50px] leading-[1.14] md:leading-[1.12] tracking-[-0.02em] font-medium mb-5\">A URL on Monday.<!-- --> <span class=\"italic text-gold-display\">A booked customer by Saturday.</span></h2><p class=\"font-body text-[17px] leading-[1.68] text-muted\">The same seven steps run for any business. Pick a sector and follow one all the way through — from reading the website to answering the enquiry it produced.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-7\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Choose a sector\"><button role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\" class=\"font-body text-[13.5px] font-medium rounded-full px-[18px] py-2.5 border transition-colors bg-gold text-[#1A1208] border-gold\">Jewellery</button><button role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"font-body text-[13.5px] font-medium rounded-full px-[18px] py-2.5 border transition-colors bg-surface text-muted border-rule hover:border-gold/40 hover:text-ink\">Textile</button><button role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"font-body text-[13.5px] font-medium rounded-full px-[18px] py-2.5 border transition-colors bg-surface text-muted border-rule hover:border-gold/40 hover:text-ink\">Snacks &amp; FMCG</button><button role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"font-body text-[13.5px] font-medium rounded-full px-[18px] py-2.5 border transition-colors bg-surface text-muted border-rule hover:border-gold/40 hover:text-ink\">Financial</button></div><div class=\"bg-[#0E0E0E] rounded-[22px] p-6 md:p-10 shadow-[0_24px_80px_rgba(0,0,0,0.30)]\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-3 mb-9 pb-6 border-b border-white/[0.07]\"><span class=\"font-heading text-[17px] text-white\">A jewellery showroom in Coimbatore</span><span class=\"font-mono text-[12px] text-white/35\">yourshowroom.com</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-8\"><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-[132px_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-x-7 gap-y-2.5\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(14px)\"><div class=\"flex md:flex-col items-baseline md:items-start gap-2.5 md:gap-1 pt-1\"><span class=\"font-mono text-[11px] tabular-nums text-brand-gold\">01</span><span class=\"text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.09em] text-white/40\">Reads your brand</span></div><div class=\"min-w-0\"><div class=\"bg-[#141414] border border-white/[0.07] rounded-[14px] p-5\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2.5\"><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:gap-4\"><span class=\"text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-white/35 sm:w-[104px] flex-shrink-0 pt-0.5\">Voice</span><span class=\"text-[14px] leading-[1.55] text-white/80\">Warm, unhurried, family-run — confident without pushing</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:gap-4\"><span class=\"text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-white/35 sm:w-[104px] flex-shrink-0 pt-0.5\">Customer</span><span class=\"text-[14px] leading-[1.55] text-white/80\">Retail buyers 28–48, wedding and festival purchases, Tamil Nadu</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:gap-4\"><span class=\"text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-white/35 sm:w-[104px] flex-shrink-0 pt-0.5\">Competitors</span><span class=\"text-[14px] leading-[1.55] text-white/80\">3 nearby showrooms tracked</span></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-[132px_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-x-7 gap-y-2.5\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(14px)\"><div class=\"flex md:flex-col items-baseline md:items-start gap-2.5 md:gap-1 pt-1\"><span class=\"font-mono text-[11px] tabular-nums text-brand-gold\">02</span><span class=\"text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.09em] text-white/40\">Builds a strategy</span></div><div class=\"min-w-0\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><span class=\"text-[13px] text-white/70 bg-white/[0.04] border border-white/[0.08] rounded-full px-[14px] py-2\">Craft and making</span><span class=\"text-[13px] text-white/70 bg-white/[0.04] border border-white/[0.08] rounded-full px-[14px] py-2\">Collections and occasions</span><span class=\"text-[13px] text-white/70 bg-white/[0.04] border border-white/[0.08] rounded-full px-[14px] py-2\">Trust and heritage</span><span class=\"text-[13px] text-white/70 bg-white/[0.04] border border-white/[0.08] rounded-full px-[14px] py-2\">Customer stories</span></div></div></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-[132px_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-x-7 gap-y-2.5\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(14px)\"><div class=\"flex md:flex-col items-baseline md:items-start gap-2.5 md:gap-1 pt-1\"><span class=\"font-mono text-[11px] tabular-nums text-brand-gold\">03</span><span class=\"text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.09em] text-white/40\">Plans the month</span></div><div class=\"min-w-0\"><div class=\"bg-[#141414] border border-white/[0.07] rounded-[14px] p-5\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-7 gap-y-2 mb-4\"><span class=\"font-heading text-[30px] text-white tabular-nums\">18</span><span class=\"text-[13.5px] text-white/60\">Posts, carousels, 2 reels</span></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-7 gap-[5px] mb-3\"><div class=\"h-[22px] rounded-[4px] bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.05]\"></div><div class=\"h-[22px] rounded-[4px] bg-brand-gold/25 border border-brand-gold/40\"></div><div class=\"h-[22px] rounded-[4px] bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.05]\"></div><div class=\"h-[22px] rounded-[4px] bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.05]\"></div><div class=\"h-[22px] rounded-[4px] bg-brand-gold/25 border border-brand-gold/40\"></div><div class=\"h-[22px] rounded-[4px] bg-brand-gold/25 border border-brand-gold/40\"></div><div class=\"h-[22px] rounded-[4px] bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.05]\"></div><div class=\"h-[22px] rounded-[4px] bg-brand-gold/25 border border-brand-gold/40\"></div><div class=\"h-[22px] rounded-[4px] bg-brand-gold/25 border border-brand-gold/40\"></div><div class=\"h-[22px] rounded-[4px] bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.05]\"></div><div class=\"h-[22px] rounded-[4px] bg-brand-gold/25 border border-brand-gold/40\"></div><div class=\"h-[22px] rounded-[4px] bg-brand-gold/25 border border-brand-gold/40\"></div><div class=\"h-[22px] rounded-[4px] bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.05]\"></div><div class=\"h-[22px] rounded-[4px] bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.05]\"></div><div class=\"h-[22px] rounded-[4px] bg-brand-gold/25 border border-brand-gold/40\"></div><div class=\"h-[22px] rounded-[4px] bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.05]\"></div><div class=\"h-[22px] rounded-[4px] bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.05]\"></div><div class=\"h-[22px] rounded-[4px] bg-brand-gold/25 border border-brand-gold/40\"></div><div class=\"h-[22px] rounded-[4px] bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.05]\"></div><div class=\"h-[22px] rounded-[4px] bg-brand-gold/25 border border-brand-gold/40\"></div><div class=\"h-[22px] rounded-[4px] bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.05]\"></div><div class=\"h-[22px] rounded-[4px] bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.05]\"></div><div class=\"h-[22px] rounded-[4px] bg-brand-gold/25 border border-brand-gold/40\"></div><div class=\"h-[22px] rounded-[4px] bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.05]\"></div><div class=\"h-[22px] rounded-[4px] bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.05]\"></div><div class=\"h-[22px] rounded-[4px] bg-brand-gold/25 border border-brand-gold/40\"></div><div class=\"h-[22px] rounded-[4px] bg-brand-gold/25 border border-brand-gold/40\"></div><div class=\"h-[22px] rounded-[4px] bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.05]\"></div></div><p class=\"text-[13px] text-white/45\">Wedding season weighted, Diwali already mapped</p></div></div></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-[132px_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-x-7 gap-y-2.5\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(14px)\"><div class=\"flex md:flex-col items-baseline md:items-start gap-2.5 md:gap-1 pt-1\"><span class=\"font-mono text-[11px] tabular-nums text-brand-gold\">04</span><span class=\"text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.09em] text-white/40\">Drafts the work</span></div><div class=\"min-w-0\"><div class=\"bg-[#141414] border border-white/[0.07] rounded-[14px] p-5\"><div class=\"text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-white/35 mb-3\">Tuesday · Instagram</div><p class=\"text-[14.5px] leading-[1.62] text-white/85\">Most of our customers don’t compare us to other jewellers. They compare us to the shop their mother trusted for thirty years. That’s the bar.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-[132px_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-x-7 gap-y-2.5\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(14px)\"><div class=\"flex md:flex-col items-baseline md:items-start gap-2.5 md:gap-1 pt-1\"><span class=\"font-mono text-[11px] tabular-nums text-brand-gold\">05</span><span class=\"text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.09em] text-white/40\">You approve</span></div><div class=\"min-w-0\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2.5\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-brand-gold text-[#1A1208] text-[13px] font-semibold rounded-full px-[18px] py-2.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg> Approve</span><span class=\"text-[13px] text-white/45 border border-white/10 rounded-full px-[16px] py-2.5\">Rewrite</span><span class=\"text-[12.5px] text-white/35 sm:ml-2\">Nothing publishes until this happens.</span></div></div></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-[132px_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-x-7 gap-y-2.5\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(14px)\"><div class=\"flex md:flex-col items-baseline md:items-start gap-2.5 md:gap-1 pt-1\"><span class=\"font-mono text-[11px] tabular-nums text-brand-gold\">06</span><span class=\"text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.09em] text-white/40\">Answers the enquiry</span></div><div class=\"min-w-0\"><div class=\"bg-[#141414] border border-white/[0.07] rounded-[14px] p-5\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-4\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" class=\"text-[#4ADE80]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M17.472 14.382c-.297-.149-1.758-.867-2.03-.967-.273-.099-.471-.148-.67.15-.197.297-.767.966-.94 1.164-.173.199-.347.223-.644.075-.297-.15-1.255-.463-2.39-1.475-.883-.788-1.48-1.761-1.653-2.059-.173-.297-.018-.458.13-.606.134-.133.297-.347.446-.52.149-.174.198-.298.298-.497.099-.198.05-.371-.025-.52-.075-.149-.669-1.612-.916-2.207-.242-.579-.487-.5-.669-.51-.173-.008-.371-.01-.57-.01-.198 0-.52.074-.792.372-.272.297-1.04 1.016-1.04 2.479 0 1.462 1.065 2.875 1.213 3.074.149.198 2.096 3.2 5.077 4.487.709.306 1.262.489 1.694.625.712.227 1.36.195 1.871.118.571-.085 1.758-.719 2.006-1.413.248-.694.248-1.289.173-1.413-.074-.124-.272-.198-.57-.347z\"></path><path d=\"M12.05 2C6.529 2 2.05 6.477 2.05 12c0 1.86.505 3.646 1.463 5.212L2 22l4.913-1.489A9.94 9.94 0 0012.05 22C17.573 22 22.05 17.523 22.05 12S17.573 2 12.05 2zm0 18.111a8.06 8.06 0 01-4.354-1.271l-.312-.187-3.239.982.98-3.207-.204-.331A8.09 8.09 0 013.94 12c0-4.478 3.633-8.111 8.11-8.111 4.478 0 8.11 3.633 8.11 8.11 0 4.479-3.632 8.112-8.11 8.112z\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-white/35\">4 minutes after the post</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2.5 mb-4\"><div class=\"self-start max-w-[80%] bg-[#1E1E1E] border border-white/[0.06] rounded-[13px_13px_13px_4px] px-4 py-3 text-[13.5px] leading-[1.5] text-white/70\">Saw your bridal collection post — do you have something in antique gold?</div><div class=\"self-end max-w-[80%] bg-brand-gold/[0.14] border border-brand-gold/25 rounded-[13px_13px_4px_13px] px-4 py-3 text-[13.5px] leading-[1.5] text-white/90\">We do — the antique bridal range is in-store now. Is this for a wedding, and roughly when?</div><div class=\"self-start max-w-[80%] bg-[#1E1E1E] border border-white/[0.06] rounded-[13px_13px_13px_4px] px-4 py-3 text-[13.5px] leading-[1.5] text-white/70\">Yes, my sister’s. Wedding is in March.</div></div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 bg-[#1A1A1A] border border-white/[0.06] rounded-[12px] px-4 py-3.5\"><div><div class=\"text-[11.5px] uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-white/35 mb-1\">Scored and handed over</div><div class=\"text-[13.5px] text-white/75\">Bridal · March timeline · private viewing booked Saturday</div></div><div class=\"font-heading text-[28px] text-brand-gold tabular-nums\">86</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-[132px_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-x-7 gap-y-2.5\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(14px)\"><div class=\"flex md:flex-col items-baseline md:items-start gap-2.5 md:gap-1 pt-1\"><span class=\"font-mono text-[11px] tabular-nums text-brand-gold\">07</span><span class=\"text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.09em] text-white/40\">Reports back</span></div><div class=\"min-w-0\"><div class=\"grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3\"><div class=\"bg-[#141414] border border-white/[0.07] rounded-[14px] px-5 py-4\"><div class=\"text-[11.5px] uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-white/35 mb-2\">Reach</div><div class=\"font-heading text-[26px] text-white mb-1 tabular-nums\">+38%</div><div class=\"text-[12.5px] text-white/40\">vs previous month</div></div><div class=\"bg-[#141414] border border-white/[0.07] rounded-[14px] px-5 py-4\"><div class=\"text-[11.5px] uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-white/35 mb-2\">Enquiries</div><div class=\"font-heading text-[26px] text-white mb-1 tabular-nums\">64</div><div class=\"text-[12.5px] text-white/40\">all answered same day</div></div><div class=\"bg-[#141414] border border-white/[0.07] rounded-[14px] px-5 py-4\"><div class=\"text-[11.5px] uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-white/35 mb-2\">Your time</div><div class=\"font-heading text-[26px] text-white mb-1 tabular-nums\">9 min</div><div class=\"text-[12.5px] text-white/40\">per week, approving</div></div></div></div></div></div></div><p class=\"text-[13px] text-faint mt-5 max-w-[70ch]\">An illustrative run-through using sector archetypes, not a client case study. The steps, formats and handover are how the product actually works; the figures are examples.</p><div class=\"mt-9\"><a href=\"/product\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[15px] font-semibold text-gold-text hover:gap-3 transition-all\">See everything both agents do <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></section><section id=\"gravity\" class=\"py-[130px] px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px]\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-[90px] items-center\"><div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)\"><span class=\"neb-label neb-label-gold mb-[22px] block\">Gravity — the marketing half</span></div><h2 class=\"font-heading text-[34px] md:text-[50px] leading-[1.14] md:leading-[1.12] tracking-[-0.02em] font-medium mb-[26px]\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)\">Stop planning content. <span class=\"italic text-gold-text\">Start approving it.</span></h2><p class=\"font-body text-[17px] leading-[1.68] text-muted max-w-[480px] mb-[34px]\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)\">Gravity starts by understanding you: your customers, your channels, what actually works. Then it plans the month and drafts the posts, carousels and reels to fill it, watching your rivals so your content never plays catch-up. Your part is the last step — tap approve.</p><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)\"><div class=\"flex gap-[13px] items-start\"><span class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-[26px] h-[26px] rounded-full bg-gold-wash flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13.5\" height=\"13.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-target text-gold-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"6\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></span><span class=\"font-body text-[15px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-2 pt-0.5\">Builds your marketing strategy first — ICP, channels, what to say</span></div><div class=\"flex gap-[13px] items-start\"><span class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-[26px] h-[26px] rounded-full bg-gold-wash flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13.5\" height=\"13.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-calendar-check text-gold-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M16 2v4\"></path><rect width=\"18\" height=\"18\" x=\"3\" y=\"4\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M3 10h18\"></path><path d=\"m9 16 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"font-body text-[15px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-2 pt-0.5\">Plans the month, then executes it — posts, carousels, reels</span></div><div class=\"flex gap-[13px] items-start\"><span class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-[26px] h-[26px] rounded-full bg-gold-wash flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13.5\" height=\"13.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-radar text-gold-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M19.07 4.93A10 10 0 0 0 6.99 3.34\"></path><path d=\"M4 6h.01\"></path><path d=\"M2.29 9.62A10 10 0 1 0 21.31 8.35\"></path><path d=\"M16.24 7.76A6 6 0 1 0 8.23 16.67\"></path><path d=\"M12 18h.01\"></path><path d=\"M17.99 11.66A6 6 0 0 1 15.77 16.67\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"></circle><path d=\"m13.41 10.59 5.66-5.66\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"font-body text-[15px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-2 pt-0.5\">Watches your rivals and drafts the counter-post, not just a report</span></div><div class=\"flex gap-[13px] items-start\"><span class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-[26px] h-[26px] rounded-full bg-gold-wash flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13.5\" height=\"13.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-trending-up text-gold-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 7h6v6\"></path><path d=\"m22 7-8.5 8.5-5-5L2 17\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"font-body text-[15px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-2 pt-0.5\">Gets sharper over time — it remembers what worked</span></div><div class=\"flex gap-[13px] items-start\"><span class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-[26px] h-[26px] rounded-full bg-gold-wash flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13.5\" height=\"13.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check text-gold-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"font-body text-[15px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-2 pt-0.5\">Nothing publishes until you tap approve</span></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-[22px] mt-[30px]\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[13px] text-faint\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-linkedin\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 8a6 6 0 0 1 6 6v7h-4v-7a2 2 0 0 0-2-2 2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7h-4v-7a6 6 0 0 1 6-6z\"></path><rect width=\"4\" height=\"12\" x=\"2\" y=\"9\"></rect><circle cx=\"4\" cy=\"4\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg>LinkedIn</span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[13px] text-faint\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-instagram\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"20\" height=\"20\" x=\"2\" y=\"2\" rx=\"5\" ry=\"5\"></rect><path d=\"M16 11.37A4 4 0 1 1 12.63 8 4 4 0 0 1 16 11.37z\"></path><line x1=\"17.5\" x2=\"17.51\" y1=\"6.5\" y2=\"6.5\"></line></svg>Instagram</span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[13px] text-faint\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-twitter\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M22 4s-.7 2.1-2 3.4c1.6 10-9.4 17.3-18 11.6 2.2.1 4.4-.6 6-2C3 15.5.5 9.6 3 5c2.2 2.6 5.6 4.1 9 4-.9-4.2 4-6.6 7-3.8 1.1 0 3-1.2 3-1.2z\"></path></svg>X</span></div><a href=\"#how-it-works\" class=\"mt-[26px] inline-block text-[15px] text-gold-text hover:underline\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)\">See how Gravity works →</a></div><div