ect-square rounded-[4px] flex items-center justify-center text-[9.5px] bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.05] text-white/20\">17</div><div class=\"aspect-square rounded-[4px] flex items-center justify-center text-[9.5px] bg-brand-gold/[0.22] border border-brand-gold/40 text-brand-gold\">18</div><div class=\"aspect-square rounded-[4px] flex items-center justify-center text-[9.5px] bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.05] text-white/20\">19</div><div class=\"aspect-square rounded-[4px] flex items-center justify-center text-[9.5px] bg-brand-gold/[0.22] border border-brand-gold/40 text-brand-gold\">20</div><div class=\"aspect-square rounded-[4px] flex items-center justify-center text-[9.5px] bg-brand-gold/[0.22] border border-brand-gold/40 text-brand-gold\">21</div><div class=\"aspect-square rounded-[4px] flex items-center justify-center text-[9.5px] bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.05] text-white/20\">22</div><div class=\"aspect-square rounded-[4px] flex items-center justify-center text-[9.5px] bg-brand-gold/[0.22] border border-brand-gold/40 text-brand-gold\">23</div><div class=\"aspect-square rounded-[4px] flex items-center justify-center text-[9.5px] bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.05] text-white/20\">24</div><div class=\"aspect-square rounded-[4px] flex items-center justify-center text-[9.5px] bg-brand-gold/[0.22] border border-brand-gold/40 text-brand-gold\">25</div><div class=\"aspect-square rounded-[4px] flex items-center justify-center text-[9.5px] bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.05] text-white/20\">26</div><div class=\"aspect-square rounded-[4px] flex items-center justify-center text-[9.5px] bg-brand-gold/[0.22] border border-brand-gold/40 text-brand-gold\">27</div><div class=\"aspect-square rounded-[4px] flex items-center justify-center text-[9.5px] bg-brand-gold/[0.22] border border-brand-gold/40 text-brand-gold\">28</div></div></div><div class=\"bg-[#1A1A1A] border border-white/[0.06] rounded-[14px] p-5 mb-[14px]\"><span class=\"neb-label neb-label-on-dark mb-3 block\">Tuesday · LinkedIn</span><p class=\"font-body text-[14.5px] leading-[1.6] text-white/85 mb-4\">Most of our customers don’t compare us to other jewellers. They compare us to the shop their mother trusted for thirty years. That’s the bar.</p><div class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-[11px] text-white/45 border border-white/10 rounded-full px-[11px] py-1\">Approve</span><span class=\"text-[11px] text-white/45 border border-white/10 rounded-full px-[11px] py-1\">Rewrite</span></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-[10px]\"><div class=\"bg-[#1A1A1A] border border-white/[0.06] rounded-xl p-[15px]\"><span class=\"neb-label neb-label-on-dark mb-[7px] block\">Queued</span><div class=\"font-heading text-[27px] text-white\">18</div></div><div class=\"bg-[#1A1A1A] border border-white/[0.06] rounded-xl p-[15px]\"><span class=\"neb-label neb-label-on-dark mb-[7px] block\">Formats</span><div class=\"font-heading text-[27px] text-white\">3</div></div><div class=\"bg-[#1A1A1A] border border-white/[0.06] rounded-xl p-[15px]\"><span class=\"neb-label neb-label-on-dark mb-[7px] block\">Your time</span><div class=\"font-heading text-[27px] text-white\">9<span class=\"text-[15px] text-white/45\">min</span></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"pulsar\" class=\"py-[130px] px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px]\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-[90px] items-center\"><div class=\"bg-[#111111] border border-white/[0.06] rounded-[20px] p-6 shadow-[0_24px_70px_rgba(0,0,0,0.45)]\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(32px)\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-5\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-[9px]\"><div class=\"w-[13px] h-[13px] rounded-full\" style=\"background:radial-gradient(circle at 34% 32%, #FFD48A 0%, #F5A623 46%, #A4650B 100%)\"></div><span class=\"font-heading text-[13.5px] font-medium text-white\">Pulsar</span></div><span class=\"neb-label neb-label-on-dark \">4 min after enquiry</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-[11px] mb-[18px]\"><div class=\"self-start max-w-[78%] bg-[#1A1A1A] border border-white/[0.06] rounded-[14px_14px_14px_4px] px-4 py-[13px] text-[13.5px] leading-[1.55] text-white/60\">Saw your enquiry about the Anna Nagar showroom — are you looking for bridal or daily wear?</div><div class=\"self-end max-w-[78%] bg-brand-gold/[0.13] border border-brand-gold/[0.22] rounded-[14px_14px_4px_14px] px-4 py-[13px] text-[13.5px] leading-[1.55] text-white/[0.88]\">Bridal. Wedding is in March.</div><div class=\"self-start max-w-[78%] bg-[#1A1A1A] border border-white/[0.06] rounded-[14px_14px_14px_4px] px-4 py-[13px] text-[13.5px] leading-[1.55] text-white/60\">Perfect — March gives us time. Would Saturday 11am suit you for a private viewing?</div></div><div class=\"bg-[#1A1A1A] border border-white/[0.06] rounded-[14px] p-[17px] flex items-center justify-between\"><div><span class=\"neb-label neb-label-on-dark mb-[6px] block\">Scored &amp; handed over</span><div class=\"text-[13.5px] text-white/75\">Bridal · March timeline · booked Saturday</div></div><div class=\"font-heading text-[30px] text-brand-gold\">86</div></div></div><div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)\"><span class=\"neb-label neb-label-gold mb-[22px] block\">Pulsar — the outreach half</span></div><h2 class=\"font-heading text-[34px] md:text-[50px] leading-[1.14] md:leading-[1.12] tracking-[-0.02em] font-medium mb-[26px]\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)\">Whoever replies first <span class=\"italic text-gold-text\">wins the sale.</span></h2><p class=\"font-body text-[17px] leading-[1.68] text-muted max-w-[480px] mb-[34px]\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)\">It happens mid-billing, mid-invoice, mid-everything — and by the time you’re free, they’ve already messaged someone else. Pulsar replies in minutes, asks the questions you’d ask, and hands you only the ones worth your afternoon.</p><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)\"><div class=\"flex gap-[13px] items-start\"><span class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-[26px] h-[26px] rounded-full bg-gold-wash flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13.5\" height=\"13.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-message-square-text text-gold-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M22 17a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6.828a2 2 0 0 0-1.414.586l-2.202 2.202A.71.71 0 0 1 2 21.286V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h16a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z\"></path><path d=\"M7 11h10\"></path><path d=\"M7 15h6\"></path><path d=\"M7 7h8\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"font-body text-[15px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-2 pt-0.5\">WhatsApp, email and SMS — written the way you&#x27;d write them</span></div><div class=\"flex gap-[13px] items-start\"><span class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-[26px] h-[26px] rounded-full bg-gold-wash flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13.5\" height=\"13.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clipboard-check text-gold-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"4\" x=\"8\" y=\"2\" rx=\"1\" ry=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"></path><path d=\"m9 14 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"font-body text-[15px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-2 pt-0.5\">Budget, timeline and fit settled before it reaches you</span></div><div class=\"flex gap-[13px] items-start\"><span class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-[26px] h-[26px] rounded-full bg-gold-wash flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13.5\" height=\"13.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-list-ordered text-gold-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11 5h10\"></path><path d=\"M11 12h10\"></path><path d=\"M11 19h10\"></path><path d=\"M4 4h1v5\"></path><path d=\"M4 9h2\"></path><path d=\"M6.5 20H3.4c0-1 2.6-1.925 2.6-3.5a1.5 1.5 0 0 0-2.6-1.02\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"font-body text-[15px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-2 pt-0.5\">Every lead scored, so your day starts at the top of the list</span></div><div class=\"flex gap-[13px] items-start\"><span class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-[26px] h-[26px] rounded-full bg-gold-wash flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13.5\" height=\"13.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-phone text-gold-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M13.832 16.568a1 1 0 0 0 1.213-.303l.355-.465A2 2 0 0 1 17 15h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2A18 18 0 0 1 2 4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-.8 1.6l-.468.351a1 1 0 0 0-.292 1.233 14 14 0 0 0 6.392 6.384\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"font-body text-[15px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-2 pt-0.5\">Voice calling where it earns its place</span></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-[22px] mt-[30px]\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[13px] text-faint\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" class=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M17.472 14.382c-.297-.149-1.758-.867-2.03-.967-.273-.099-.471-.148-.67.15-.197.297-.767.966-.94 1.164-.173.199-.347.223-.644.075-.297-.15-1.255-.463-2.39-1.475-.883-.788-1.48-1.761-1.653-2.059-.173-.297-.018-.458.13-.606.134-.133.297-.347.446-.52.149-.174.198-.298.298-.497.099-.198.05-.371-.025-.52-.075-.149-.669-1.612-.916-2.207-.242-.579-.487-.5-.669-.51-.173-.008-.371-.01-.57-.01-.198 0-.52.074-.792.372-.272.297-1.04 1.016-1.04 2.479 0 1.462 1.065 2.875 1.213 3.074.149.198 2.096 3.2 5.077 4.487.709.306 1.262.489 1.694.625.712.227 1.36.195 1.871.118.571-.085 1.758-.719 2.006-1.413.248-.694.248-1.289.173-1.413-.074-.124-.272-.198-.57-.347z\"></path><path d=\"M12.05 2C6.529 2 2.05 6.477 2.05 12c0 1.86.505 3.646 1.463 5.212L2 22l4.913-1.489A9.94 9.94 0 0012.05 22C17.573 22 22.05 17.523 22.05 12S17.573 2 12.05 2zm0 18.111a8.06 8.06 0 01-4.354-1.271l-.312-.187-3.239.982.98-3.207-.204-.331A8.09 8.09 0 013.94 12c0-4.478 3.633-8.111 8.11-8.111 4.478 0 8.11 3.633 8.11 8.11 0 4.479-3.632 8.112-8.11 8.112z\"></path></svg>WhatsApp</span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[13px] text-faint\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-mail\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m22 7-8.991 5.727a2 2 0 0 1-2.009 0L2 7\"></path><rect x=\"2\" y=\"4\" width=\"20\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg>Email</span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[13px] text-faint\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-message-square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M22 17a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6.828a2 2 0 0 0-1.414.586l-2.202 2.202A.71.71 0 0 1 2 21.286V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h16a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z\"></path></svg>SMS</span></div><a href=\"#how-it-works\" class=\"mt-[26px] inline-block text-[15px] text-gold-text hover:underline\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)\">See how Pulsar works →</a></div></div></section><section id=\"pricing\" class=\"py-[130px] px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px]\"><div class=\"max-w-[620px] mb-[62px]\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)\"><span class=\"neb-label neb-label-gold mb-[22px] block\">Pricing</span></div><h2 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[34px] md:text-[50px] leading-[1.14] md:leading-[1.12] tracking-[-0.02em] mb-5\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)\">Cheaper than the hire. <span class=\"italic text-gold-text\">Faster than the agency.</span></h2><p class=\"font-body text-[17px] leading-[1.68] text-muted\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)\">A marketing executive costs ₹30,000–50,000 a month, plus tools, plus six weeks of interviews, plus the morning they hand in their notice. This starts working on Thursday.</p></div><div class=\"bg-surface border border-rule rounded-[20px] overflow-hidden mb-[62px]\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)\"><div class=\"px-6 md:px-9 pt-7 pb-5\"><div class=\"neb-label\">What you&#x27;d otherwise be paying for</div></div><div class=\"px-6 md:px-9\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 py-4 border-t border-rule\"><span class=\"font-body text-[14.5px] text-ink-2\">A marketing hire</span><span class=\"font-body text-[14.5px] text-muted text-right\">₹30,000–50,000/mo</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 py-4 border-t border-rule\"><span class=\"font-body text-[14.5px] text-ink-2\">A designer for creatives</span><span class=\"font-body text-[14.5px] text-muted text-right\">₹12,000–20,000/mo</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 py-4 border-t border-rule\"><span class=\"font-body text-[14.5px] text-ink-2\">Scheduling &amp; content tools</span><span class=\"font-body text-[14.5px] text-muted text-right\">₹3,000–5,000/mo</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 py-4 border-t border-rule\"><span class=\"font-body text-[14.5px] text-ink-2\">WhatsApp Business API / CRM</span><span class=\"font-body text-[14.5px] text-muted text-right\">₹5,000–10,000/mo</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 py-4 border-t border-rule\"><span class=\"font-body text-[14.5px] text-ink-2\">Someone to answer leads fast</span><span class=\"font-body text-[14.5px] text-muted text-right\">₹8,000–12,000/mo</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 py-4 border-t border-rule\"><span class=\"font-body text-[14.5px] text-ink-2\">Weeks spent interviewing</span><span class=\"font-body text-[14.5px] text-muted text-right\">4–6 weeks, before they start</span></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 md:px-9 py-6 border-t border-rule-2 bg-surface-2\"><span class=\"font-heading text-[20px] md:text-[22px] font-medium\">Doing it yourself</span><span class=\"font-heading text-[20px] md:text-[22px] font-medium text-muted tabular-nums\">₹58,000–97,000+/mo</span></div><div class=\"px-6 md:px-9 pt-7 pb-5 border-t border-gold/[0.18] bg-gold/[0.05]\"><div class=\"neb-label neb-label-gold\">What you get instead</div></div><div class=\"px-6 md:px-9 bg-gold/[0.05]\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 py-3.5 border-t border-gold/[0.14]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check text-gold-text flex-shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"font-body text-[14.5px] text-ink-2\">Strategy and ICP, built from your URL</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 py-3.5 border-t border-gold/[0.14]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check text-gold-text flex-shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"font-body text-[14.5px] text-ink-2\">A month of content planned and drafted</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 py-3.5 border-t border-gold/[0.14]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"cu